        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12cff48514b508a9e933ca04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对方是特雷森学园里最顶尖的长途跑者。以她现在的程度，\n要想在2400米的测试中跑出好成绩并赢下测试，是很困难的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc0cd2e7218106b77ad2d45bd6c18a551ac9aa66d286cd810f34286994a761cc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
