      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……里见光钻，我有重要的事情要跟你说",
      "source_fingerprint": "2335067fa2e22172b863c8cc5a00bacd99eed4d0676ebfb0146ed01f529c757a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1067/storytimeline_041067003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a082b7b167a0c99b38e2d36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "先回到原点吧。重要的是理清“什么才是最优先”。\n我决定和里见光钻合作最主要的原因是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb9d00fd52291aef6351b64dd6f123f9b00fa874cef31aadea381d86912f13d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
