      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──！？里见，你……\n你这一身泥巴的样子……真的能好好比赛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e3c9efc5abd72f9cae7cae5b3db15d6c466f7c74cde3ff453397872a42a4ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
