      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，里见、训练员，测验的审查员是我。\n一个月后你要和我比赛，让我见识你们的能耐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13e75025f465afbae8b7bdb23fdec3ddd2a1b86096167103c6187a5ab4e42ebf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
